    "//test:quick": "只跑「受当前改动影响」的测试（jest --onlyChanged / vitest --changed），编辑循环用；全量门禁仍是 test:unit + CI。--passWithNoTests 必需：没有受影响的测试时两者默认 exit 1，会把「本次改动确实没碰到任何测试」误报成红。未覆盖 Python 侧（pytest 无等价 changed 模式）与 desktop（其 test 脚本串了 40+ 个 selftest，本就秒级）。",
    "test:quick": "npm run test:quick:api && npm run test:quick:node && npm run test:quick:web && npm run test:quick:cli && npm run test:quick:mcp && npm run test:quick:node-sdk",
    "test:quick:api": "cd apps/admin-api && npm test -- --onlyChanged --passWithNoTests",
    "test:quick:node": "cd apps/executor-node && npx jest --onlyChanged --passWithNoTests",
    "test:quick:web": "cd apps/admin-web && npx vitest run --changed --passWithNoTests",
    "test:quick:cli": "cd packages/acf-cli && npx vitest run --changed --passWithNoTests",
    "test:quick:mcp": "cd packages/mcp-server && npx vitest run --changed --passWithNoTests",
    "test:quick:node-sdk": "cd packages/autocodeflow-node-sdk && npx jest --onlyChanged --passWithNoTests",
